<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuador is under a fourth curfew through Nov. 10 in five coastal provinces as violence spikes, while the military launches its first land operation against cartels with U.S. assistance. US Marines seized a vessel linked to the Los Choneros gang in the eastern Pacific. Heavy rain on Santa Cruz Island killed one person and left two missing, and a priest was killed when a crucifix fell on him, prompting an archbishop to announce a clergy safety plan. President Daniel Noboa continues to detain opposition leader Luisa González on money-laundering charges. The crisis previously recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQSkt5MElKcUpTejFTb0puV0c5WWE5QnprZkQ5QUV5Z0dJMmY0WkxjXzZ5TjM4QkNMcDA1VWdrZ1UtZ3d6QmJRQnIwMGIyWGJnUmduUG9tUHhlTHlxMzJ1ckFWdm0wWFRvYzdRZVVGalJ3bHRPcmdnOEZPOHBSR1JrVm85SWZab1g1MjlacEJFaHFWUV9SdXlaaDZ4SzR0V28?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOOVJvWUdRcVpIU2h0amJQQmJpZlQ5UFAtTEVKZy13b2l4RkJlSDEwNkhiZUFKWXlsMG56YmdUbk1tTFlOWEVlOU1ySHNFQUtNWUtLZzZyUGxlWmNzTmNuem9oVEg5MzVqWWRJSUMzSnBIZzczSmdqZ0RkSy1wR3dTaXZlS3Z4TUktenYyZ0N1VDFBc28?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC Wildlife Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQcmhlc1paLWM2WC1SWE9JbnVuVUlqMzNnVFBVNVNJR05vVTVkYktVaWQ3NThnWFNyNGFRYUQ1MTJyM0JUVTJFSlNZV2tURFhQZzJ5d0o3SHJWaHdJT1lGSjB1d1RIV1hTczdXQzhuRnBCSGp4eDg4aHUxeTlkakpxV1p0TXBia0k2TXBILUlMZ0ZXU0tiUm45N3lLZ2JhOGZyZWE0?oc=5&quot;&gt;streamlinefeed.co.ke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE1tQ2RpT3pjTzJoMHlXN0lMVGRTZ1R4aW9qTlRxRExQcHEwc2s0YXdWdHlnd0d4OWgyYjBkZjhlQXZnb19vT3JUZktqS2NzcWctRWcyS1JzSWFfeHZwTjVaOE9Oczl0Z09a?oc=5&quot;&gt;World Socialist Web Site&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a h